- **Style:** Authentic Cava bar with Catalan sandwiches (bocadillos) and cured meats.
- **Top Dishes:** Their signature **Pink Cava** (Rosat), the **hot Chorizo sandwich**, and a shared platter of **Ibérico ham or Fuet**. 
