*   **Practicalities:** Locals eat late! Don’t show up before 21:00 if you want the real atmosphere. Thursday through Saturday are the peak nights. For **La Rambla Paella House, a reservation is highly recommended** and I can certainly handle that for you to ensure you get a prime table on the terrace. For Can Paixano, they don’t take reservations—you just push your way in!

