**The vibe:**
Standing only. Loud. Hams hanging from the ceiling. Barrels everywhere. You'll be shoulder-to-shoulder with Catalans arguing about Barça. Expect 30-45 minutes — this isn't a linger-over-dinner place, it's a "drink cava, eat ham, feel alive" place.

**Reservations & timing:**
No reservations (or tables). Walk in. **Go early** (before 19:00) or late (after 21:00) to avoid peak crush. Closed Sundays. Cash only.

