*   **Reservation Tips:** This place is in high demand because it caters to both discerning visitors and locals. Reservations are **highly recommended**. I can prioritize this for you to ensure you get a good table (terrace vs. indoor).

### Option 2: Can Paixano (La Xampanyeria)
A historic cava bar located in Barceloneta.

*   **Why locals go:** This is strictly a pre-dinner snack spot. Locals stop here for 20 minutes to grab a very cheap glass of cava and a sandwich before going to a "real" dinner elsewhere.
*   **Must-order dishes:** House pink cava and a pork sandwich. Note: this place doesn't really do "dinner" dishes; it is almost exclusively cured meats and bread.
