- Menus in 8+ languages with photos
- "Tourist menu" prominently displayed
- Staff aggressively recruiting from the sidewalk
- Empty at 9pm but "busy" at 7pm (that's tourist dinner time)
- TripAdvisor "Travelers' Choice" stickers everywhere but no Spanish being spoken inside
- Paella "ready in 10 minutes" (real paella takes 20-25 minimum)

