Alex, you came to me asking for "memorable, very local, not a tourist trap." Based on everything you've told me—your willingness to embrace authentic chaos, your "rather pay for quality" mindset, and your genuine curiosity about local culture—**I recommend Can Paixano (La Xampanyeria)**.

