Hi Alex! Welcome to Barcelona. It is wonderful to connect with you. I completely understand what you are looking for—balancing authenticity with a bit of comfort is the key to enjoying this city without getting exhausted by the "tourist hustle."

To answer your initial questions quickly so we can get to the food:

