Why locals go: The house cava (specifically the pink cava) is €1.50 per glass, and they serve enormous bocadillos stuffed with jamón ibérico, fuet, and manchego that are carved to order. Locals pile in after work (7-9pm) for cheap drinks and simple, quality Catalan staples.

